{"3583000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "2Deez", "steam_appid": 3583000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The distilled essence of ripping your friends a new mind hole. A minimalist fighting game based on the core fundamentals of 3D fighting games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story mode with 10 chapters, featuring characters such as a cursed rat, a cotton candy monster, and a cabal of evil wizards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your own custom palette... with <u><strong>HATS!!!1!!1</strong></u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offline Play with Bots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offline Versus Mode for local play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online lobby play with Rollback Netcode, chat, and spectators</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replays to watch the games you've played, with replay takeover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-Game command list with frame data</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An in-depth training mode with hitbox viewer, frame data display, a macro editor, and ability to save training macros to JSON</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make and fight against your own bots</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The distilled essence of ripping your friends a new mind hole. A minimalist fighting game based on the core fundamentals of 3D fighting games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story mode with 10 chapters, featuring characters such as a cursed rat, a cotton candy monster, and a cabal of evil wizards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your own custom palette... with <u><strong>HATS!!!1!!1</strong></u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"